251ZM245 403Q188 403 142 361T96 250Q96 183 141 140T250 96Q284 96 313 109T354 135T375 160Q403 197 403 250Q403 313 360 358T245 403Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-39\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2218\" x=\"1415\" y=\"557\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> triangle is <strong>NOT</strong> regular since neither the sides nor the angles are all congruent.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-ce714ddd178c0fa90d5a47226c5d3e17\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/ce714ddd178c0fa90d5a47226c5d3e17\"></div>\n        </div>",
